WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:09.259
Having a Mexican restaurant
in the United States is a paradox.

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:15.348
On the one hand, we have a culture
that despises Mexican people.

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:20.562
And on the other hand,
Mexican food is an integral part

00:00:20.645 --> 00:00:21.938
of the American Diet.

00:00:24.232 --> 00:00:25.775 position:56%
Cala is a very different restaurant.

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:29.320 position:64%
It is a restaurant that accepts everyone.

00:00:30.613 --> 00:00:33.199 position:66%
Cala was completely inspired by Contramar.

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:36.953 position:59%
In Mexico,
our co-workers are part of our family.

00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:40.206
Even with the language barriers,
even the cultural differences,

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:43.710 position:59%
the bond that we've been able to build
working together,

00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:46.337
it opens up doors
and it opens up conversations.

00:00:46.421 --> 00:00:49.132 position:61%
And so we're trying to teach each other
and listen and just connect

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.968
because we need to
pull some of these walls down.

